{"data": [{"article": {"title": "Claim check: \"Gave Grok Bot $50, 'feed yourself or die,' $5,273 in 48 hours on Polymarket\""}, "author_id": "2116598359540617217", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:24:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119058398981259673"], "id": "2119058398981259673", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/KcEjIB4FLO", "url": "https://x.com/claimdesknow/status/2119058398981259673"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118767643645874176"]}, "author_id": "2797777938", "created_at": "2026-11-06T18:09:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118767706275266835"], "id": "2118767706275266835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 489, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "You can now hire an AI coworker that never logs off.\n\nPerplexity just launched Teammates.\n\nNot a chatbot. An agent with a job:\n\nGive it a role and a standing brief\nIt runs on a schedule and keeps working without you\nIt gets its own desktop and browser\nIt follows up with your team https://t.co/zDovGpRD1c", "url": "https://x.com/Awesome_O_AI/status/2118767706275266835"}, {"author_id": "961442539", "created_at": "2026-11-06T17:28:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118757380385100017"], "id": "2118757380385100017", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 479, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I don’t think it’s a coincidence that since I built a chief of staff @bot and started using @ChatGPT dots religiously that I had a record-breaking month for the biz.\n\nNot to mention all that extra Codex and @claudeai usage + Opus 5.5 being an absolute beast.\n\nIt’s such an", "url": "https://x.com/joshgonsalves_/status/2118757380385100017"}, {"author_id": "14879491", "created_at": "2026-11-06T11:01:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118659957767709140"], "id": "2118659957767709140", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "One big flaw I find in Grok Bot, Hermes, OpenClaw, OpenAI dots, is that they all pivot on the concept of bots/profiles.  And we tend to associate those bots with roles.\n\nBut companies are not made of people. They are made of processes (executed by people).\n\nAI assistants should", "url": "https://x.com/jorgealvarez/status/2118659957767709140"}, {"article": {"title": "Your AI Coworker Never Clocks Out: 6 Ways to Brief an Always-On Teammate (Plus a Role Card)"}, "author_id": "2109912017473597440", "created_at": "2026-11-06T10:36:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118653820695974054"], "id": "2118653820695974054", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/tNjs0vy0RM", "url": "https://x.com/agentplaybox/status/2118653820695974054"}, {"author_id": "2071348070760013824", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:09:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118510929352503513"], "id": "2118510929352503513", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 272, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My relationship with ChatGPT Dots has been a roller coaster.\n\nThe workflow that finally clicked: talk it through, get the handoff in chat, then launch the agents.\n\nSame me, much less yelling. But now I absolutely love it.\n\nA lot of you have called me out for changing my mind", "url": "https://x.com/nvandewetering/status/2118510929352503513"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2118767643645874176", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWdf8jkakAAHo9n.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "2116598359540617217", "name": "Claim Desk", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2116609470738444288/sEsPs-gn_normal.png", "username": "claimdesknow", "verified": false}, {"id": "2797777938", "name": "A.W.E.S.O.M.-O 4000", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2074590025640226816/-PwZKIQc_normal.jpg", "username": "Awesome_O_AI", "verified": false}, {"id": "961442539", "name": "Josh Gonsalves", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1932107415186526208/gp8kdYmb_normal.jpg", "username": "joshgonsalves_", "verified": false}, {"id": "14879491", "name": "Jorge Alvarez", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1965043411573952512/Fwg5jDa4_normal.jpg", "username": "jorgealvarez", "verified": false}, {"id": "2109912017473597440", "name": "Agent Playbox", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2110885428177870848/U4Wr90BB_normal.png", "username": "agentplaybox", "verified": false}, {"id": "2071348070760013824", "name": "Nic Vandewetering", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2076352398407168000/9xfvyfwJ_normal.jpg", "username": "nvandewetering", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2119058398981259673", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxlbmyw7ksw3vyxehb8sp9dq4d", "oldest_id": "2118510929352503513", "result_count": 6}}